      ],
      "returnType": "Void",
      "docs": "Writes the data used by the AssetRegistry in each package; the format of this data is separate from the\nformat of the data in the asset registry.\nThe corresponding read functions are ReadPackageDataMain and ReadPackageDataDependencies; they are are declared\nin IAssetRegistry.h, in the AssetRegistry module, because they depend upon some structures defined in the\nAssetRegistry module"
    },
